msgstr "Visite la oficina de despachos"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3169
#, lua-format
msgctxt "DispatchOffice-comms"
msgid "Excellent work on your last assignment, %s. You may stand down or take another assignment"
msgstr "Excelente trabajo en su última asignación, %s. Usted puede ponerse de pie o tomar otra asignación"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3171 scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3302 scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3364
msgctxt "DispatchOffice-comms"
msgid "Stand down"
msgstr "¡Arriba!"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3172 scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3303 scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3365
msgctxt "DispatchOffice-comms"
msgid "Congratulations and thank you"
msgstr "Felicitaciones y gracias"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3178
msgctxt "DispatchOffice-comms"
msgid "Move to next region of available missions"
msgstr "Mover a la siguiente región de las misiones disponibles"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3179 scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3218
#, lua-format
msgctxt "DispatchOffice-comms"
msgid "Dock with station %s for the details of your next assignment. Beware the asteroids"
msgstr "Puerta con estación %s para los detalles de su próxima asignación. Cuidado con los asteroides"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3183 scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3222 scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3249 scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3288
#, lua-format
msgctxt "DispatchOffice-comms"
msgid "Dock with station %s"
msgstr "Puerta con estación %s"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3187 scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3216 scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3253 scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3282
msgctxt "DispatchOffice-comms"
msgid "Request next assignment"
msgstr "Solicitar próxima asignación"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3241
#, lua-format
msgctxt "DispatchOffice-comms"
msgid "Welcome to %s station, %s. We're glad you're here. These are your choices for assignments"
msgstr "Bienvenido a %s estación, %sEstamos contentos de que estés aquí."

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3244
#, lua-format
msgctxt "DispatchOffice-comms"
msgid "Move on to missions in %s area"
msgstr "Muévanse a las misiones en %s zona"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3245 scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3284
#, lua-format
msgctxt "DispatchOffice-comms"
msgid "Dock with station %s for your next assignment"
msgstr "Puerta con estación %s para su próxima asignación"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3313
#, lua-format
msgctxt "DispatchOffice-comms"
msgid "Welcome, %s. Everything is bigger at %s station. We could use your help with one of these mission options"
msgstr "Bienvenida. %sTodo es más grande %s Estacion. Podríamos usar tu ayuda con una de estas opciones de misión"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3315
msgctxt "Exuari1-comms"
msgid "Exuari Exterminates Extraterrestrials"
msgstr "Exuari Extermina Extraterrestres"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3316
msgctxt "Exuari1-comms"
msgid "The Exuari have unlimited resources and continually send more ships of greater and greater power and nastier surprises. No victory condition exists"
msgstr "El Exuari tiene recursos ilimitados y envía continuamente más barcos de mayor y mayor poder y sorpresas más grandes. No existe condición de victoria"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3318 scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3328
msgctxt "DispatchOfficeOrders-comms"
msgid "Confirm"
msgstr "Confirmación"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3320
#, lua-format
msgctxt "Exuari1-comms"
msgid "The Exuari are on their way. They will target you and the assets in and around %s"
msgstr "El Exuari está en camino. Ellos te atacarán y los activos dentro y alrededor %s"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3325
msgctxt "Exuari2-comms"
msgid "Eliminate Exuari stronghold"
msgstr "Eliminar la fortaleza de Exuari"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3326
msgctxt "Exuari2-comms"
msgid "The Exuari have unlimited resources, but they are constrained to funnel them through their stronghold. Obtain victory by finding and destroying the Exuari stronghold."
msgstr "El Exuari tiene recursos ilimitados, pero se ven obligados a embriagarlos a través de su fortaleza. Obtenga la victoria encontrando y destruyendo la fortaleza de Exuari."

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3330
msgctxt "Exuari2-comms"
msgid "Good luck"
msgstr "Buena suerte."

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3335
msgctxt "Exuari3-comms"
msgid "Survive Exuari offensive"
msgstr "Survive Exuari ofensiva"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3336
msgctxt "Exuari3-comms"
msgid "The Exuari launch their invasion offensive. You must survive their attack. You will have a limited amount of time during which you must survive"
msgstr "El Exuari lanzará su ofensiva de invasión. Usted debe sobrevivir a su ataque. Usted tendrá una cantidad limitada de tiempo durante el cual usted debe sobrevivir"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3338
msgctxt "Exuari3-comms"
msgid "15 minutes"
msgstr "15 minutos"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3342 scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3350 scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3358
msgctxt "Exuari3-comms"
msgid "The countdown has begun"
msgstr "La cuenta regresiva ha comenzado"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3346
msgctxt "Exuari3-comms"
msgid "30 minutes"
msgstr "30 minutos"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3354
msgctxt "Exuari3-comms"
msgid "45 minutes"
msgstr "45 minutos"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3374
msgctxt "Polly-comms"
msgid "Pick up astronomer Polly Hobbs"
msgstr "Recoge al astrónomo Polly Hobbs"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3375
msgctxt "Polly-comms"
msgid "[Polly Hobbs] Thank you for picking me up. I found the source of the anomalous readings near the end of the inner solar asteroid belt. I've brought specialized scanning instruments, but they must be closer than 1 unit to be effective. Also, we will need baseline scan data from your ship's instruments"
msgstr "[Polly Hobbs] Gracias por recogerme. He encontrado la fuente de las lecturas anómalas cerca del final del cinturón de asteroides solares internos. He traído instrumentos especializados de escaneo, pero deben estar más cerca de 1 unidad para ser efectivas. Además, necesitaremos datos de escaneo de base de los instrumentos de su barco"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3377
msgctxt "Polly-comms"
msgid "Bring astronomer Polly Hobbs close to artifact for additional sensor readings"
msgstr "Traiga al astrónomo Polly Hobbs cerca del artefacto para lecturas de sensores adicionales"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3384
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "Pick up planetologist"
msgstr "Recoge el planetaólogo"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3385
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "I'm not sure he's ready. He's not at the dock ready to board or in the transporter room. Our station is undergoing repairs, so several systems are offline"
msgstr "No estoy seguro de que esté listo, no está en el muelle listo para abordar o en la sala del transportador."

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3386
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "Look for planetologist"
msgstr "Busca a un planetaólogo"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3387
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "The likeliest places to find him are his quarters, the lab or the observation lounge"
msgstr "Los lugares más agradables para encontrarlo son sus habitaciones, el laboratorio o el salón de observación"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3388
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "Try his quarters"
msgstr "Pruebe sus cuartos"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3395
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "[Enrique Flogistan] Yes? What can I do for you? Please be quick about it, I'm in a bit of a hurry"
msgstr "¿Qué puedo hacer por ti?"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3397
#, lua-format
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "Ready to begin your observations of %s?"
msgstr "Listo para comenzar sus observaciones de %s?"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3405
#, lua-format
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "[Enrique Flogistan] Almost. Let me grab something from %s"
msgstr "[Enrique Flogistan] Casi. %s"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3408
#, lua-format
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "We are here to transport you to %s"
msgstr "Estamos aquí para transportarlo a %s"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3414
#, lua-format
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid ""
"[Enrique Flogistan] You're not my normal transport representative. Besides, I still need to pack a few things.\n"
"\n"
"He heads off down the corridor towards %s"
msgstr "No eres mi representante de transporte normal, además, tengo que empacar algunas cosas. %s"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3418
#, lua-format
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "My ship, %s, is here to transport you"
msgstr "Mi nave, %s, está aquí para transportarte"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3419
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "Is your ship armed?"
msgstr "¿Está armado tu nave?"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3421
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "Yes, we can handle any Exuari in the area"
msgstr "Sí, podemos manejar cualquier Exuari en la zona"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3430 scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3705
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "He's already boarded a ship"
msgstr "Ya ha subido a un barco."

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3432
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid ""
"Good. Let's go\n"
"\n"
"He joins you as you go back to the ship"
msgstr "Bien, vamos, él se une a ti mientras regresas a la nave."

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3437
#, lua-format
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "Good. I still need a couple of items from %s"
msgstr "Bien, todavía necesito un par de artículos de %s"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3454
#, lua-format
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "He's not in his quarters. His digital room assistant predicts he went to %s"
msgstr "No está en sus cuartos, su asistente de la sala digital predice que fue a %s"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3458
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "Try the lab"
msgstr "Prueba el laboratorio."

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3465
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "[Enrique Flogistan] Hello, welcome to the planetology lab. Can I help you?"
msgstr "Hola, bienvenido al laboratorio de planetaología. ¿Puedo ayudarle?"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3467
#, lua-format
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "Ready to go observe %s?"
msgstr "Listo para ir a observar %s?"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3473
#, lua-format
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid ""
"[Enrique Flogistan] Almost. Let me get one more thing.\n"
"\n"
"He leaves the lab for %s"
msgstr "[Enrique Flogistan] Casi. Déjame conseguir una cosa más. %s"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3477
#, lua-format
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "We're ready to transport you to %s"
msgstr "Estamos listos para transportarlo a %s"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3484
#, lua-format
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid ""
"[Enrique Flogistan] Already?!\n"
"\n"
"He quickly leaves the lab. The lab technician looks over as he leaves\n"
"\n"
"[Lab technician] I think he's going to %s"
msgstr "[Enrique Flogistan] Ya?! Él rápidamente sale del laboratorio. El técnico del laboratorio mira mientras deja [Lab técnico] Creo que va a %s"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3493
#, lua-format
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "%s has docked and is waiting on you"
msgstr "%s ha atracado y te está esperando"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3494
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "Are you aware of the Exuari that have been spotted in the area?"
msgstr "¿Está consciente del Exuari que ha sido visto en la zona?"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3496
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "Yes, don't worry about them"
msgstr "Sí, no te preocupes por ellos."

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3498
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "[Enrique Flogistan] Good to know. I need to finishing packing in my quarters"
msgstr "[Enrique Flogistan] Me alegro de saberlo."

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3502
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "[Enrique Flogistan] Good to know. I left some notes in the observation lounge"
msgstr "[Enrique Flogistan] Me alegro de saberlo. Dejé algunas notas en el salón de observación"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3518
#, lua-format
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "[Lab technician] You just missed him. I think he said he was going to %s"
msgstr "Creo que él dijo que iba a ir a casa. %s"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3522
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "Try observation lounge"
msgstr "Prueba salón de observación"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3532
#, lua-format
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "[Enrique Flogistan] Just take in the gorgeous view of %s from here"
msgstr "[Enrique Flogistan] Sólo tienes que tomar en la hermosa vista de %s de aquí"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3534
#, lua-format
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "Ready for a closer view of %s?"
msgstr "Listo para una vista más cercana %s?"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3541
#, lua-format
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid ""
"[Enrique Flogistan] Just about. I forgot to pack something.\n"
"\n"
"He leaves the observation lounge to go to %s"
msgstr "Me olvidé de empacar algo, deja el salón de observación para ir a %s"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3545
#, lua-format
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "We're ready to take you to %s"
msgstr "Estamos listos para llevarte a %s"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3548
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "[Enrique Flogistan] Well I'm not. I just need a few more items from my quarters"
msgstr "[Enrique Flogistan] Bueno no lo soy. Sólo necesito unos cuantos más artículos de mis trimestres"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3552
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "[Enrique Flogistan] Well I'm not. I just need a few more items from the lab"
msgstr "[Enrique Flogistan] Bueno no lo soy. Sólo necesito algunos artículos más del laboratorio"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3558
#, lua-format
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "%s has been ordered to get you to %s"
msgstr "%s ha sido ordenado para conseguir que usted %s"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3560
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "I heard about your encounter with the Exuari. You know they could come back, right?"
msgstr "Me enteré de tu encuentro con el Exuari. ¿Sabes que podrían volver, verdad?"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3562
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "Certainly. We'll be ready, don't worry"
msgstr "Estaremos listos, no te preocupes."

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3564
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "[Enrique Flogistan] I admire your confidence. I'll get my things from my quarters"
msgstr "[Enrique Flogistan] Admiro su confianza."

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3568
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "[Enrique Flogistan] I admire your confidence. I'll get my research material from the lab"
msgstr "[Enrique Flogistan] Admiro su confianza. Voy a conseguir mi material de investigación del laboratorio"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3585
#, lua-format
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "[Station repair crewman] He just left for %s"
msgstr "Acaba de salir para %s"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3591
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "Contact planetologist directly"
msgstr "Contacte con el planetaólogo directamente"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3592
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "Repair work prevents contact with individual"
msgstr "Trabajo de reparación evita el contacto con el individuo"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3593
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "Contact Enrique Flogistan's quarters"
msgstr "Contactar con Enrique Flogistan's quarters"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3595
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "[Enrique Flogistan] Who is it?"
msgstr "¿Quién es?"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3598
#, lua-format
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "This is %s. We are your transportation to %s"
msgstr "Esto es... %sSomos su transporte a %s"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3606
#, lua-format
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "I'm going to %s before we leave"
msgstr "Voy a ir %s antes de que nos vayamos"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3615
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "No reply from Enrique Flogistan's quarters"
msgstr "No hay respuesta de los barrios de Enrique Flogistan"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3619
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "Contact planetology lab"
msgstr "Contactar laboratorio de planetaología"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3630
#, lua-format
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "A lab technician answers and tells you Enrique Flogistan is probably going to %s"
msgstr "Un técnico de laboratorio responde y le dice que Enrique Flogistan probablemente va a %s"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3633
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "Contact observation lounge"
msgstr "Salón de observación de contacto"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3644
#, lua-format
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "A repair crewman answers and tells you Enrique Flogistan is probably going to %s"
msgstr "Un tripulante de reparación responde y le dice que Enrique Flogistan probablemente va a %s"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3647
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "Contact station galley"
msgstr "Estación de contacto galera"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3649
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "[Cook] Hello, who's there?"
msgstr "Hola, ¿quién está ahí?"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3651
#, lua-format
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "I'm from %s. I'm looking for Enrique Flogistan"
msgstr "Soy de %sEstoy buscando a Enrique Flogistan"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3652
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "He was here about an hour ago. You might try his quarters, the observation lounge or the lab"
msgstr "Estaba aquí hace una hora, podrías probar sus habitaciones, el salón de observación o el laboratorio."

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3658
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "Contact station security office"
msgstr "Oficina de seguridad de la estación de contacto"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3660
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "[Security officer] May I help you?"
msgstr "¿Puedo ayudarle?"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3662
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "I'm looking for Enrique Flogistan"
msgstr "Estoy buscando a Enrique Flogistan"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3664
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "He's not here in the security office. Our records show he often frequents his quarters, the observation lounge and the planetology lab"
msgstr "No está aquí en la oficina de seguridad. Nuestros registros muestran que a menudo frecuenta sus habitaciones, el salón de observación y el laboratorio de planetaología."

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3669
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "Contact station maintenance office"
msgstr "Oficina de mantenimiento de la estación de contacto"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3671
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "[Maintenance technician] Hi, what's broken?"
msgstr "Hola, ¿qué está roto?"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3673
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "Nothing. I'm looking for Enrique Flogistan"
msgstr "Nada, estoy buscando a Enrique Flogistan."

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3675
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "He's not here. Good luck finding him"
msgstr "No está aquí."

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3680
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "Contact station operations office"
msgstr "Oficina de operaciones de estación de contacto"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3682
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "[Operations manager] Yes?"
msgstr "¿Sí?"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3684
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "Can you help me find Enrique Flogistan?"
msgstr "¿Puedes ayudarme a encontrar a Enrique Flogistan?"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3686
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "He's not here in operations. We are short handed right now with all the repairs going on. I'm afraid you'll have to find him yourself"
msgstr "No está aquí en operaciones, estamos cortos ahora mismo con todas las reparaciones."

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3692
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "Scan for planetologist"
msgstr "Escáner para el planetaólogo"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3701
#, lua-format
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "Sensors show him in %s"
msgstr "Los sensores le muestran %s"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3702
#, lua-format
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "Beam him over from %s"
msgstr "Lo atrapó de %s"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3707
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "He has been beamed aboard"
msgstr "Ha sido a bordo."

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3712
msgctxt "planetologist-comms"
msgid "Interference from station repairs prevents a transporter lock"
msgstr "Interferencia de las reparaciones de la estación previene una cerradura del transportador"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3722
msgctxt "satellites-comms"
msgid "Satellite problems?"
msgstr "¿Problemas por satélite?"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3723
#, lua-format
msgctxt "satellites-comms"
msgid "Yes. Our technicians have tracked back the problem to a faulty relay module. However, They are unable to fix it with available parts. They need %s. They've requested delivery, but hear it will take weeks before the next delivery cycle. I don't suppose you could bring us what we need?"
msgstr "Sí. Nuestros técnicos han rastreado el problema a un módulo de relé defectuoso. Sin embargo, no pueden arreglarlo con partes disponibles. %sHan solicitado la entrega, pero escuchan que tardará semanas antes del próximo ciclo de entrega. ¿No supongo que puedan traernos lo que necesitamos?"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3736 scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3792
#, lua-format
msgctxt "satellites-comms"
msgid "Provide %s"
msgstr "Proporción %s"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3740
msgctxt "satellites-comms"
msgid "Thanks. With your help, we fixed the faulty relay module"
msgstr "Gracias, con tu ayuda, arreglamos el módulo de relé defectuoso"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3750
msgctxt "satellites-comms"
msgid "Having satellite trouble?"
msgstr "¿Teniendo problemas por satélite?"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3752
#, lua-format
msgctxt "satellites-comms"
msgid "It seems we've got an outdated servo motor. Replacement will take time. Our repairman says he can fix it with %s, so we don't have to wait. Do you have any?"
msgstr "Parece que tenemos un motor de servo anticuado. %sAsí que no tenemos que esperar. ¿Tienes alguno?"

#: scripts/scenario_48_visitors.lua:3764
#, lua-format
msgctxt "satellites-comms"
msgid "Give %s to %s"
msgstr "Dale. %s a %s"

